  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1747302952_3917844_41898f364c26ad66e6fb3d1fd76f8e43.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">• Brand introduction:</p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 41, 55); font-family: Inter; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\" id=\"isPasted\">I wanted to share some backstory on our brand and vision. As a completely new name introducing a relatively unknown ingredient, conveying our story is a unique challenge. Having spent many years creating and guiding beauty brands, I can honestly say I've encountered almost everything the industry has to offer. However, my perspective shifted dramatically when I met my co-founder. They were exploring the potential of this ingredient for medical applications, and my immediate reaction was, 'Absolutely not!' Photolyase is such a transformative, restorative game-changer; it belongs in beauty. And so, Elisir Skin was born..<br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 41, 55); font-family: Inter; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Our Photoluminate Formula is the cornerstone of the Elisir Skin family, the foundational product for achieving truly healthy skin. We believe the inherent quality of your skin lies within its DNA – that's the ultimate determinant of its health and appearance. By actively supporting and strengthening your skin's DNA, we empower each individual to achieve the best skin they can genuinely possess.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 41, 55); font-family: Inter; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">I urge you to explore the research on the Photolyase enzyme yourself; I'm confident you'll be astounded by its capabilities.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 41, 55); font-family: Inter; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Speaking from personal experience, my 53-year-old skin has never looked this vibrant, and it’s certainly seen its fair share of life! I've even shared unfiltered before-and-after photos of my own skin on our social media – the difference is remarkable.</span><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br>• Product description:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Elisir Skin's<strong>&nbsp;Photoluminate Formula&nbsp;</strong>contains photolyase, a light-activated enzyme, to directly address the skin's DNA damage resulting from visible light exposure, including blue light. This sophisticated mechanism supports the skin's natural repair processes.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:341\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Aptos Light&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">The formulation is fortified with a potent blend of antioxidants, specifically Vitamins C and E, to neutralise free radicals and minimize oxidative stress. Additionally, advanced UV filters provide comprehensive protection against photodamage, targeting key contributors to pigmentation irregularities, fine lines, and collagen depletion.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Payment terms: 30 days</p></div></div>",
